Some entities (E11–E18) were excluded by my filter, so I'll fetch them now, along with the rest of the data.

```sql
SELECT * FROM entities WHERE entity_id IN ('E11','E12','E13','E14','E15','E16','E17','E18','E19','E20') OR name ILIKE '%Orrin%' OR name ILIKE '%Brindle%' OR name ILIKE '%Marlow%' OR name ILIKE '%Halden%' OR name ILIKE '%Corvenia%' OR name ILIKE '%Northwind%' OR name ILIKE '%Valdoria%' OR country='LU' ORDER BY entity_id;
```

```sql
SELECT * FROM rating_actions WHERE rated_id NOT IN (SELECT entity_id FROM entities WHERE entity_id LIKE 'E1___') AND rated_id NOT LIKE 'I1%' ORDER BY rated_id, date;
```

```sql
